GitHub Changelog - March 2026

Copilot coding agent for Teams
Assign an issue to Copilot and it opens a pull request with the change, tests, and a description. Now included in Copilot Business at no additional cost.

Actions cost controls
Set a monthly spend limit per repository and get notified at 75%. Runner minutes now show per workflow in the billing page.

Code review summaries
Every pull request gets a generated summary of what changed and why, with links to the relevant lines.

Also: secret scanning for 40 new token types, and a redesigned repository insights page.

Read the changelog: https://github.blog/changelog/2026-03

